_ Nitpick (assertive)_

**Use null for absent PluginManager to match API contract**

getPluginManagerInstance returns PluginManager | null. Returning undefined here can mask bugs. Prefer null for fidelity.


```diff
 (getPluginManagerInstance as ReturnType<typeof vi.fn>).mockReturnValue(
-  undefined,
+  null,
 );
