![critical](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/critical.svg)

This change introduces a new violation of the Rules of Hooks. The `devUseWarning` function is a hook (it uses `useContext` internally) and cannot be called inside the `useEffect` callback. Hooks must be called at the top level of a component.

To fix this, you should move the `devUseWarning` call outside of the `useEffect`.

Additionally, there's another conditional hook call on line 78 that was missed. It would be best to have a single `devUseWarning('Input')` call at the top of the component and reuse the returned `warning` function for both the deprecation warning and this effect.

Here is a suggested fix for this block:

```suggestion
  const warning = devUseWarning('Input');
  useEffect(() => {
    if (process.env.NODE_ENV !== 'production') {
      if (inputHasPrefixSuffix && !prevHasPrefixSuffix.current) {
        warning(
          document.activeElement === inputRef.current?.input,
          'usage',
          `When Input is focused, dynamic add or remove prefix / suffix will make it lose focus caused by dom structure change. Read more: https://ant.design/components/input/#FAQ`,
        );
      }
      prevHasPrefixSuffix.current = inputHasPrefixSuffix;
    }
  }, [inputHasPrefixSuffix]);
```

_️ Potential issue_

**Make globals stubbing configurable and capture originals to prevent redefinition errors and test bleed.**

Overriding window.location without `configurable: true` and without saving originals is brittle; repeated runs can throw and contaminate other tests. Do the same for localStorage.


```diff
   beforeEach(() => {
-    mockReload = vi.fn();
+    mockReload = vi.fn();
+    // capture original descriptors for full restoration
+    locationDescriptor = Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor(window, 'location')!;
+    localStorageDescriptor = Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor(window, 'localStorage')!;

     // Use Object.defineProperty for TypeScript compatibility
     Object.defineProperty(window, 'location', {
       value: {
         ...window.location,
         reload: mockReload,
       },
-      writable: true,
+      writable: true,
+      configurable: true,
     });

     vi.clearAllMocks();
     Object.defineProperty(window, 'localStorage', {
       value: localStorageMock,
-      writable: true,
+      writable: true,
+      configurable: true,
     });
   });
```


Also applies to: 51-55

