<summary> Prompt for AI Agents</summary>

```
In src/utils/getRefreshToken.spec.ts around lines 39 to 49 (and similarly lines
51 to 55), the test overrides window.location and localStorage directly which
can throw on repeated runs and leak state; capture the original window.location
and original localStorage at the start, replace them using Object.defineProperty
with configurable: true and writable: true, and set mocked implementations
(e.g., reload) there; ensure tests restore the originals in an
afterEach/teardown hook to avoid bleed; apply the same pattern for the
localStorage stub (capture original, defineProperty with configurable: true,
restore after tests).
```

</details>

