Paazl expects length/width/height as whole centimeters (integers). Send either L/W/H or volume, not both. ([support.paazl.com](https://support.paazl.com/hc/en-us/articles/360034275994-Initializing-the-Paazl-Checkout-widget?utm_source=openai))

