_️ Potential issue_ | _ Major_

**Clear the auto-connect timeout.**  
This effect schedules a timeout but never cancels it. If the user switches tabs or unmounts within 2.5s, the stale callback still fires, kicking off USB/BLE setup on the wrong view and mutating state after unmount. Track the timer id and clear it in the cleanup.


```diff
-  useEffect(() => {
-    setTimeout(async () => {
+  useEffect(() => {
+    const timer = setTimeout(async () => {
       if (isUSB) {
         await onConnectWebDevice();
       } else {
         await startBLEConnection();
       }
     }, 2500);
     return () => {
-      stopScan();
+      clearTimeout(timer);
+      stopScan();
     };
   }, [isUSB, onConnectWebDevice, startBLEConnection, stopScan]);
```

