```

Changing from `&EventDataBatch<'_>` to `EventDataBatch<'_>` is a breaking API change. This should be clearly documented in the changelog and migration notes should be provided for users.
```suggestion
    ///
    /// # Breaking change
    /// 
    /// **v0.x.x:** The `send_batch` method previously accepted a reference to an `EventDataBatch` (`&EventDataBatch<'_>`).
    /// It now takes ownership of the batch (`EventDataBatch<'_>`). This is a breaking change.
    /// 
    /// ## Migration notes
    /// - Change calls from `producer.send_batch(&batch, ...)` to `producer.send_batch(batch, ...)`.
    /// - The batch will be moved and cannot be used after calling this method.
    ///
```
